<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Petroleum Securities changes name.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Petroleum Securities changes name.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil explorer Petroleum Securities Australia Ltd said on Monday that its shareholders had approved a change in the company's name to Petsec Energy Ltd.</p>
<p>The company's main production and exploration assets are in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
